              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BABSKITCHEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were very good and very easy to make. I used Mexican cheese instead of mozzarella and jalapeño peppers instead of hot pepper sauce. I found that 1 avocado was enough. I served this with salsa and sour cream. I served this as a main dish and probably should have doubled the recipe. It didn't go quite far enough for 4 people. Would make a great appetizer! Thanks, Cody!",
            "datePublished": "2003-03-30T16:08:39.327Z"
