            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! I ommited the olives, and added 1 diced tomato and 1/4 of an onion instead. I mixed the avacado, tomato and onion in a bowl with salt and pepper before adding to quesadilla. It came out delicous! Will definitely be making these again!",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-17T21:02:27.407Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
