            "reviewBody": "Hey Smosh... Currently watching culinary crimes and wanted to make a snack... So...I switched out the corn tortilla's for tomato slasa torrilla's I had in my cupboard... I switched out the shredded mozzarella for lactose free pizza mozzarella...I didn't have black olives so I used canned corn instead... I had some bacon maple bacon left over from breakfast that I chopped up and put in there for some protein... All my avocados were bad so I skipped that.... To dip I have some greek yogurt that I mixed with some hot sauce to dip... 10/10 would recommend",
